Z||000000||88 Database Guy||06-11-2001||01:56 PM||||I'm trying to restore to OEM condition some calipers for my future show car.  Has anyone found a duplicate paint for the calipers?  There are two different finishes, and the paint I'm talking about is the light grey color on the body of the caliper (the part with the piston in it). As for the other part of the caliper (with the metallic, brassy finish), does anyone know what this finish is?  Some kind of plating maybe?  <P>Thanks for any help,<P>John Willhoff,  88 Database Nut now with info on 2,652 1988 Fieros (over 10%!).<BR>john.willhoff@lmco.com, BJWillhoff@aol.com, (770) 578-6556||||reg||1
